ristics**\\n\\nI’m considering how to analyze audio segments. It seems like starting with silence makes sense, and from there, I need to identify speech-like segments that have variable volume and pauses. I wonder if estimating the continuity of speech would help. Perhaps I could count the chunks that exceed a certain threshold. This could guide my understanding of when the speaking occurs and how it flows! Let’s explore!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_vvGGMCGYW9RY1I5pxKbnNaMS|fc_017d8e8ae2d554ef0169e8d02fed288191b90368fb7f35c0c4","name":"update_plan","arguments":{"plan":[{"step":"Inspect audio file and available local media tools","status":"completed"},{"step":"Derive cautious preliminary screening summary from audio and clinical context","status":"in_progress"},{"step":"Return concise patient-safe result for main agent","status":"pending"}],"explanation":"Audio metadata and basic acoustic pattern review completed. No reliable speech-content extraction available, so summary will stay cautious and preliminary."},"partialJson":"{\"plan\":[{\"step\":\"Inspect audio file and available local media tools\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"step\":\"Derive cautious preliminary screening summary from audio and clinical context\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"step\":\"Return concise patient-safe result for main agent\",\"status\":\"pending\"}],\"explanation\":\"Audio metadata and basic acoustic pattern review completed. No reliable speech-content extraction available, so summary will stay cautious and preliminary.\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":310,"output":131,"cacheRead":8576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9017,"cost":{"input":0.0007750000000000001,"output":0.001965,"cacheRead":0.002144,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004884}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776865324245,"responseId":"resp_017d8e8ae2d554ef0169e8d02c8efc819187c1371612e5b659"}}
